## 4. Verification & Test Report Summary

| Test ID | Module | Test Scenario | Verified Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **TC-01** | Auth & Roles | Public registration attempt with `mentor` role injection | Creates `student` role only; password stored as `PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256` hash. |
| **TC-02** | Admin Provisioning | Local Admin creates a Mentor account and signs in | Mentor account provisioned in SQLite with access to CSV model trainer. |
| **TC-03** | Security Hardening | Repeated failed logins and `POST` without valid CSRF token | Rate-limiting triggers; missing CSRF or cross-origin requests return `403`. |
| **TC-04** | Account Isolation | Student A attempts to view or delete Student B's records | Access denied; queries strictly scoped to authenticated `student_id`. |
| **TC-05** | Grade Trends | Log 2 marks in Subject X and 3 marks (sharp jump) in Subject Y | Subject X shows no trend; Subject Y shows linear trend capped at $\pm 10$ pts. |
| **TC-06** | Ridge Regression | Mentor uploads valid 6-column de-identified CSV | Fits on deterministic 80/20 split; publishes `MAE`, `RMSE`, $R^2$, baseline `MAE`. |
| **TC-07** | Data Minimization | Inspect `sarathi.db` after CSV training and score estimation | Only weights & metrics saved; zero raw CSV rows or student inputs on disk. |
| **TC-08** | Score Estimator | Student submits study-context features | Returns instant score estimate + holdout error metrics + limitation notice. |
| **TC-09** | Study Planner | Student generates weekly plan with uneven subject averages | Allocates higher hours to weaker subjects across Concepts/Practice/Revision/Review. |
| **TC-10** | Live Mentor Chat | Student and Mentor exchange messages in active browser sessions | Delivered instantaneously via authenticated SSE and persisted in SQLite. |
